---
// AboutSection.astro - Company background and story
---

<!-- About Section -->
<section class="py-20 sm:py-28 px-4 sm:px-6 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center">
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-8 text-gray-900">
      Built on a Proven Imaging Network
    </h2>

    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
      USRad is built on the foundation of a diagnostic imaging network that
      connected more than 1,200 imaging centers and helped deliver over $246
      million in patient savings.
    </p>

    <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      After decades of helping employers and insurers reduce imaging costs,
      we're now bringing that same model directly to patients.
    </p>

    <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-10 tracking-wide">
      Created by the founder of AnciCare, one of the first nationwide diagnostic
      imaging networks.
    </p>
    <a
      href="/about"
      class="text-[#003087] font-medium hover:underline
    transition-all"
      >Read the full story →
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
